%SIXMD 1
# @?CRC - CALCULATE CRC-16-CCITT

## DESCRIPTION

READS CHARACTER INPUT AND PRINTS THE CRC-16-CCITT VALUE IN OCTAL.

USAGE IS 'CRC'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/CRC
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/CRC.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

